  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Opt 103.02 Office Hours, Office Location, Mailing Address, Telephone, and TTY/TDD.\n\n(a) The board's offices are located at:\n\nOffice of Professional Licensure and Certification\n\n7 Eagle Square\n\nConcord, NH 03301\n\n(b) The offices are open to the public Monday through Friday, excluding state legal holidays, from 8:00 a.m. to 4:00 p.m.\n\n(c) Correspondence shall be addressed to the board at the location stated in Opt 103.02(a).\n\n(d) The office of professional licensure and certification (OPLC) telephone number is (603) 271-2152.\n\n(e) The OPLC’s TTY/TTD number is 1-800-735-2964.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at part heading for Opt 100) #5839, eff 6-17-94, EXPIRED: 6-17-00\n\nNew. #7370, INTERIM, eff 9-30-00, EXPIRED: 3-29-01\n\nNew. #7607, eff 12-5-01; ss by #14211, eff 5-10-25 (formerly Opt 103.03)",
